# Launch Logo and run a language self-test: CK prints a dot for a pass.
70.0 key 0 12 1
70.1 key 0 12 0
73.0 type filer_run resources:$.apps.!logo\n
78.0 key 4 7 1
78.1 key 4 7 0
84 type MAKE "N 0\n
100.0 type TO CK :A :B\n
103.5 type IFELSE EQUALP :A :B [TYPE ".] [PRINT "FAIL MAKE "N :N + 1]\n
114.7 type END\n
116.7 type CK 1 + 2 * 3 7\n
120.8 type CK (1 + 2) * 3 9\n
125.1 type CK 10 / 4 2.5\n
129.0 type CK -3 + 1 -2\n
132.6 type CK 2 - 5 -3\n
